%SIXMD 1
# @?CLEAR - CLEAR THE TERMINAL SCREEN

## DESCRIPTION

CLEAR WRITES THE TERMINAL FORM-FEED CONTROL CHARACTER TO STANDARD OUTPUT.
TERMINALS THAT SUPPORT FORM FEED CLEAR THEIR VISIBLE SCREEN AND RESET THE
CURSOR TO THE HOME POSITION.  USAGE IS 'CLEAR'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OUTPUT FAILED
